# head_compare: production vs the GPTQ-expert hybrid, each on its OWN calibration   (run 2026-09-16)
#
# Both arms are the same commit cc7abde71a472b84ed4ab6b2c734812b810f6be9
# (= origin/main at ad87ebb73 + EXPERT_CAPTURE = True), the same lane t,r,sf6,batch,q0, the same
# fleet, the same window, and the same corpus fed the same way (133 conversations, 417,189 prompt
# tokens). Neither boot was calibrating: POST /v1/engine/calibration answered 404 "every pack it
# serves was already calibrated" on both, and neither printed a foreign/RTN warning.
#
#   A   production ranks  st-glm53-9391-up-gate-full      (st-glm53-b12x-up-gate-v1)
#                         476 blobs, today's recalibration
#   B   hybrid ranks      st-glm53-hybrid-gptq-v1         (st-glm53-modelopt-up-gate-bf16-dense-v1)
#                         235 blobs, summed on THIS arm's own weights over three boots
#
# B2partial is the same hybrid arm one boot earlier: 176 of its 235 sites calibrated, the other 59
# still RTN (they were deferred by the calibration budget on the first boot).

